note: "L sorted" gives a sorted copy, like "sort L" without changing L
let scores be a list of 72, 95 and 88.
say scores sorted.
say scores sorted biggest first.
say scores sorted smallest first.
say scores.
let names be a list of "Bob", "Al" and "Cyrus".
say names sorted by their length.
say names sorted by their length longest first.
say names sorted joined with "-".
say the first item of (scores sorted biggest first).
let l be a list of (a list of 1) and (a list of 2).
let r be l reversed.
add 5 to the end of item 1 of r.
say l.
let s be l sorted by their length.
add 6 to the end of item 1 of s.
say l.
say (a list of 3, 1 and 2) sorted.
keep fixed as a list of 3, 1 and 2.
say fixed sorted.
